  "description": "July 1999: What befell the people was not the apocalypse, but superpowers?! Thanks to this, the 21st century became an era where heroes and villains clashed. The loner villain Pyeong-Hwa runs into the hero Sa-Rang while on the run. In a tense situation, Sa-Rang unexpectedly proposes to Pyeong-Hwa with a ring... \n\nA love story unfolds between Sa-Rang and a Benz with a broken steering wheel, living in their own romantic comic book, and their chase-and-betrayal.\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
